{"ref":"BDB, עָנָף","hw":"עָנָף","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָנָף</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>branch(es), bough(s)</strong>;—usually sg. coll., abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> <em>branches</em> of vine <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.8\">Ez 17:8</a>, pl. only sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנָפֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:11\" href=\"/Psalms.80.11\">ψ 80:11</a> (both in fig.); <em>boughs</em> of tree, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנַף</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:40\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.40\">Lv 23:40</a>, sf. (as if from *<span dir=\"rtl\">עֶנֶף</span> Kö<sup>ii. 1, 74</sup>) <span dir=\"rtl\">עַנְפְּכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.8\">Ez 36:8</a>; sg. abs. (in fig.) <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:19\" href=\"/Malachi.3.19\">Mal 3:19</a>, of cedar <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.23\">Ez 17:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.3\">31:3</a>.","next":"BDB, עָנֵף","prev":"BDB, ענף"}